[ceiling] These four square rail bearings retain the frame against vertical lift and preserve the enclosure's production sliding profile. Each groove opens along its outer flank and Y entrance for support removal before assembly. The bearings require four bed-rooted supports. The stored native slice illustrates this arrangement; the current frame requires its own slice and physical removal and fit review.
